==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Persian|148}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Persian}}.
*{{m|Shadow Claw}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Persian}} can learn via [[TM]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

